From 6e6c011f3155eca3ae725b164d48dc2b59511e5a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "michael.introini@gmail.com" <michael.introini@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 4 Mar 2017 10:32:30 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] mdb.c was re-written as mdb-lookup and implemented
 correctly.

The implementation was not iterating through the DB correctly, which
caused the linked list to contain the same record for every link.
